      "content": "thanks for the tip. i'll check the pending stuff. but it's just so weird though... it's not like one big chunk is missing, it's like these little pieces are being picked off one by one. it's like they're specifically avoiding my notice, just lurking in the background and making everything messy. do you think it's possible for a software glitch to actually \"hide\" things this way, or like, purposefully keep them out of sight while the rest of the data looks fine?",
